WEBVTT

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:01.423
Še 15 ur,

00:10:01.423 --> 00:10:03.949
kar bi bilo za večino plavalcev
dolgo časa.

00:10:03.949 --> 00:10:10.040
(Smeh) (Aplavz)

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:14.708
Pojma nimate,
koliko 15-urnih treningov je za mano.

00:10:14.708 --> 00:10:18.426
Tako sem, nekako, brez odločitve,

00:10:18.426 --> 00:10:20.785
nehala šteti zamahe

00:10:20.785 --> 00:10:24.536
in nisem pela
ali citirala Stephena Hawkinga

00:10:24.536 --> 00:10:27.134
in parametrov vesolja,

00:10:27.134 --> 00:10:29.795
samo zatopila sem se
v premišljevanje o teh sanjah

00:10:29.795 --> 00:10:32.755
in zakaj in kako.